# Imported UI/UX Absorption Policy

> **2026-06-24:** Lovable paste 트랙 폐기. `presentation-import` 존은 **in-tree 유지 코드**로 취급.  
> **Phase D:** presentation layer **deleted** — `DEMOLITION_PLAN` Batch only · 돈 게이트(Σ=0 · advisor 0) 우선.

> **현재 상태:** v5 Demolition 이후 비활성. 아래 정책은 pre-demolition history이며,
> Phase R 전에 import zone, paste zone, shell zone을 복구하지 않는다.

## Absolute UI/UX Rule

- Pre-demolition import/absorption workflow is not an active implementation path.
- Do not recreate deleted imported presentation zones before Phase R defines a new presentation architecture.
- Future external reference use must be redefined by Phase R plan/ADR.

## No Source Residue

- Keep source/vendor/process labels out of future user-facing UI.
- Names such as `presentation-import`, `Imported*`, and `PresentationRoot` are historical labels, not current targets.

## Engine Boundary (money safety)

- Engine/DB/RPC changes **allowed** per active roadmap. Money paths: draft → local `db reset` → SQL Σ=0 · hash-chain → advisor 0 before done.
- UI may display hook/RPC values but must not recompute money, payouts, PnL, odds, fees, rewards, or balances.

## Conversion surfaces (Earn/Home — SSOT aligned)

Per `docs/SSOT/PRODUCT_PRINCIPLES.md` · `docs/SSOT/EARN_UX_CANON.md` · `90-ui-ux-presentation`:

- Home/Casino/Landing/Auth may show social proof as **presentation string display props** (not engine mutations)
- Restrained FOMO · streaks · activity feeds allowed when copy is **truthful and eligibility-visible**
- **Forbidden:** exaggerated rewards · false urgency · false deadlines · guaranteed-profit claims · deceptive social proof

## Allowed Import Zones

- Pre-demolition import zones below were deleted in v5 Demolition and are not active targets:
  - `apps/web/src/components/ui/*`
  - `apps/web/src/components/shell/*`
  - `apps/web/src/presentation-import/*`
  - `apps/web/src/styles/presentation-import-tokens.css`
  - Compatibility shims: `apps/web/src/shims/*`, `apps/web/src/lib/utils.ts`, `apps/web/src/lib/motion.ts`, `apps/web/src/hooks/use-toast.ts`

Do not recreate these zones before Phase R defines a new presentation architecture.
Historical mentions of `@phonara/ui` or imported presentation zones are not current implementation instructions.

